{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17564","headline":"和段相公登武担寺西台 · 姚向","name":"和段相公登武担寺西台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"开阁锦城中，余闲访梵宫。\n九层连昼景，万象写秋空。\n天半将身到，江长与海通。\n提携出尘土，曾是穆清风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚向","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17564.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17564","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}